- User profiles.
- Protected dashboards.
- User privacy controls.

PHASE 3 — MODERATION
- Moderator roles.
- Moderation queue.
- Approval and dismissal.
- Audit logging.
- Report sanitization.

PHASE 4 — AI
- AI provider adapter.
- Structured AI responses.
- Explainable classifications.
- Safety evaluations.
- Fallback analyzer.
- Privacy controls.

PHASE 5 — BUSINESS
- Organization accounts.
- Business dashboard.
- Team access.
- Analytics.
- Subscription foundations.

PHASE 6 — PRODUCTION
- Rate limiting.
- Monitoring.
- Security hardening.
- Automated testing.
- Deployment.
- Backups.
- Documentation.

Do not skip foundational work to build flashy features.

